{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Several sets of prime numbers, such as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c970896bd493c2bf552340c55c6997025f65ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{7,83,421,659\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" /> use each of the nine nonzero digits exactly once. What is the smallest possible sum such a set of primes could have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1bb0f492a95e2cfb8b4fe37e8735ef573b3b697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }193 \\qquad \\text{(B) }207 \\qquad \\text{(C) }225 \\qquad \\text{(D) }252 \\qquad \\text{(E) }447$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Neither of the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be a units digit of a prime. Therefore the sum of the set is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/6146b2e01ac9cdceb3e260e2906cbc450ee479ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 + 60 + 80 + 1 + 2 + 3 + 5 + 7 + 9 = 207$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"338\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We can indeed create a set of primes with this sum, for example the following sets work: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/c/75c5c7f3721e0f0e81558b2b88852feb753a1a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 41, 67, 89, 2, 3, 5 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/5422d0b6553871fab09388f644bcf46e6f19aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 43, 61, 89, 2, 5, 7 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8ce958432b2239ca7384475b81459b03b400fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$207\\implies \\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"115\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V6z7GiitBUM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V6z7GiitBUM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18